{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:24669ff48290c187","name":"Doctor","source":{"id":"source:reference-24669ff48290c187","title":"Doctor","revision":18900,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:56:43Z","sha256":"bf71432b8aedad5e95d0d4df8e35ada49306a939797cecd16aaf98475b5ea981","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18900","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Doctor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-24669ff48290c187","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Doctors are skilled physicians trained to handle a variety of injuries and ailments, from blaster injuries to an outbreak of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorrean Rot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorrean_Rot?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Like ",{"tag":"a","children":["Field Medics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Field_Medics?action=edit&redlink=1"},", Doctors are expected to respond quickly and think fast on their feet, but unlike their field counterparts, Doctors' patients are typically brought to them. Doctors usually need a medical environment to perform ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery"}," or install ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cybernetic Prostheses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybernetic_Prostheses"}," to replace irreparably damaged limbs and organs. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A typical Doctor could be part of a much larger medical medical institution, perhaps working in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core World"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_World?action=edit&redlink=1"}," hospital or as a part of a facility that trains other would-be physicians. He or she might be a \"country\" Doctor who oversees the health needs of a small community. Others still could be military Doctors, working in hospital tents or on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"}," where they attend injured soldiers, desperately trying to stay on top of the mounting casualties. Finally, a Doctor might be a vile surgeon who practices his cutting-edge techniques on unwilling subjects.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Doctor Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Typically, Doctors are not opponents the heroes should face on the battlefield. Instead, Doctors serve to keep the characters on their feet between battles, repairing extensive injuries and fixing physical ailments. Sometimes a Doctor is all that stands between a hero and death, especially when a character is suffering from a vile ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," or obscure ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disease"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disease"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Many Doctors run private businesses, perhaps out of small shops on an industrial world or as part of a large hospital's trained staff. Others serve in military outfits, lending their talents to the war effort by patching up casualties before sending them back to the front lines.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Doctor Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, 2 Unassigned\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":